# Loss Rules

## Structure
Use `LossContainer` + `LossComponent` for multi-loss setups. Each component needs `pred_key` and `target_key` pointing to the data container.

## Adding a Loss
1. `src/loss/my_loss.py` — subclass `nn.Module`
2. Config with `_target_`, `pred_key`, `target_key`
3. Update `src/loss/README.md` and `src/loss/ARCHITECTURE.md`
